              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bheka, kwavela kuleyo mikhawulo owesifazane waseKhanani, wakhala kuye, wathi: “Ngihawukele, Nkosi, Ndodana kaDavide; Indodakazi yami ikhwelwe kabi yidemoni.",
