              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJesu wayesebizela kuye abafundi bakhe, wathi: “Ngiyasihawukela isixuku, ngokuba sekuyizinsuku ezintathu behlezi nami, bengenalutho lokudla;",
          "type": "text",
