              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wazithabatha izinkwa eziyisikhombisa nezinhlanzi, wabonga, wazihlephula, wanika abafundi bakhe, abafundi baphakela izixuku.",
          "type": "text",
